  "phrase": "Glück haben",
  "english": "to be lucky",
  "usage": "Er hatte Glück, dass er den letzten Zug noch erwischt hat.\nHe was lucky to catch the last train.\n\nExample Sentences in Different Tenses\nPresent: \"Du hast Glück!\" (You are lucky!)\nPast (Präteritum): \"Wir hatten Glück mit dem Wetter.\" (We were lucky with the weather.)\n\nPresent Perfect (Perfekt): \"Ich habe Glück gehabt.\" (I have been lucky / I got lucky.)\n\nSubjunctive / Conditional: \"Wenn wir Glück haben, finden wir einen Parkplatz.\" (If we are lucky, we will find a parking spot.)",
  "quiz_score": 0
